  "description": "Optional transport-agnostic control facade add-on for Orleans.Lattice schema management. Wraps the in-process schema admin surface (policy, versioning, remediation and migration, and a read-only per-tree compliance audit) behind fail-closed control interfaces every transport binding (for example the gRPC surface) adapts over; remediation, migration and compliance scans run as accept-then-poll operations polled for status and progress. Registered separately; adds no transport behaviour of its own.",
